{"unit_id":"tag:0A0A:statement","translation":"<LOCKED_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为 <MATH_0003> 的完美（perfect）对象（objects）组成的系统（system）。设 <MATH_0004> 为导出（derived）余极限（colimit）（《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》定义 <REF_0001>）。则对任意对象（object）<MATH_0005>，属于 <MATH_0006>，有\n<MATH_0007>，\n其中 <MATH_0008> 为对偶（dual）完美复形（perfect complexes）组成的逆系统（inverse system）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"perfect","target_term":"完美"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统"},{"source_term":"derived","target_term":"导出"},{"source_term":"colimit","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"dual","target_term":"对偶"},{"source_term":"perfect complexes","target_term":"完美复形"},{"source_term":"inverse system","target_term":"逆系统"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"系数位点"},{"source_term":"perfect","target_term":"完美","context":"系统中各对象的性质"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"系统成员"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统","context":"导出余极限的输入"},{"source_term":"derived","target_term":"导出","context":"修饰余极限"},{"source_term":"colimit","target_term":"余极限","context":"与导出共同表达 derived colimit"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"引用章节"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"比较的另一个输入"},{"source_term":"dual","target_term":"对偶","context":"逆系统的成员"},{"source_term":"perfect complexes","target_term":"完美复形","context":"对偶系统成员"},{"source_term":"inverse system","target_term":"逆系统","context":"对偶的箭头方向"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0A0A:proof","translation":"由引理 <REF_0001>，有\n<MATH_0001>，\n它置于区别三角（distinguished triangle）\n<MATH_0002>\n中。由于 <MATH_0003> 同样置于区别三角（distinguished triangle）\n<MATH_0004>\n中，只需证明 <MATH_0005>。这形式地由（<REF_0002>）以及导出张量积（derived tensor product）与直和（direct sums）交换（commutes）这一事实得出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"区别三角"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"区别三角"},{"source_term":"derived tensor product","target_term":"导出张量积"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"区别三角","context":"导出极限的比较"},{"source_term":"derived tensor product","target_term":"导出张量积","context":"对偶比较"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和","context":"余极限的构造"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"张量积与直和"}],"notes":[]}
