{"unit_id":"tag:0FPW:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n刻画可逆（invertible）对象（objects），位于赋环位点（ringed site）的导出范畴（derived category）中（包括局部赋环拓扑斯（locally ringed topos）的情形和一般情形）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"invertible","target_term":"可逆"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"locally ringed topos","target_term":"局部赋环拓扑斯"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"invertible","target_term":"可逆","context":"本节主题"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"可逆的导出对象"},{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"系数位点"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"可逆性的环境"},{"source_term":"locally ringed topos","target_term":"局部赋环拓扑斯","context":"本节的特例"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0FPX:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。令 <MATH_0002>。考虑由 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）组成的范畴（category），它们是有限自由（finite free）<MATH_0004>-模（modules）的直和因子（summands）。该范畴等价（equivalent）于由有限（finite）投射（projective）<MATH_0005>-模（modules）组成的范畴（category）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"summands","target_term":"直和因子"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"projective","target_term":"投射"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"系数位点"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"两个系数范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"比较的环境"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由","context":"投射系数的表示"},{"source_term":"summands","target_term":"直和因子","context":"有限投射条件"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"全局截面比较"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"投射系数的有限性"},{"source_term":"projective","target_term":"投射","context":"全局截面系数的性质"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0FPX:proof","translation":"注意，有限（finite）投射（projective）<MATH_0001>-模（module）与有限自由（finite free）<MATH_0002>-模（module）的直和因子（summand）是一回事。等价（equivalence）由函子（functor）<MATH_0003> 给出。逆（inverse）函子（functor）由以下构造给出。考虑拓扑斯的态射（morphism of topoi）<MATH_0004>，其中 <MATH_0005> 由取全局截面（global sections）给出，而 <MATH_0006> 将集合（set）<MATH_0007>，即 <MATH_0008> 的对象（object），送到取值为 <MATH_0009> 的常值（constant）层（sheaf）。利用恒等映射（identity map）<MATH_0011>，得到赋环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）的态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0010>。\n于是逆（inverse）函子（functor）由 <MATH_0012> 给出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"projective","target_term":"投射"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"summand","target_term":"直和因子"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"global sections","target_term":"全局截面"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"常值"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"identity map","target_term":"恒等映射"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"投射系数的有限性"},{"source_term":"projective","target_term":"投射","context":"系数的性质"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"有限投射系数"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由","context":"投射系数的表示"},{"source_term":"summand","target_term":"直和因子","context":"有限投射条件"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价","context":"两个系数范畴的比较"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"比较及其逆"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆","context":"比较的逆方向"},{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯的态射","context":"全局截面态射"},{"source_term":"global sections","target_term":"全局截面","context":"直接像"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"常值层输入"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"集合拓扑斯的对象"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"常值","context":"逆像层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"常值层"},{"source_term":"identity map","target_term":"恒等映射","context":"系数比较"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯","context":"系数态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"赋环比较"}],"notes":[]}
